TCP DEMO:

LenseBuyer and LenseServer

must run LenseServer with a store name input as command line argument
e.g., 

   java LenseServer CVS


run client using

   java LenseBuyer "foo"

where foo is the name of a contact lens brand (e.g.,  "New Vues", Focus).

Corresponding data file is contacts.dat



UDP DEMO:

vmListener and vmReporter

  java vmListener port#

  java vmReporter machinename  port#


(where the port# should be the same for both and the machinename reflects
the client's host)
